{"4265920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Co-Drive Chaos", "steam_appid": 4265920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Drive Chaos – One Car, Two Drivers, Endless Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a car together with a friend and make your way through the courses. If you can, of course. In this 3D obstacle course game that puts your friendship to the test, a little tension, a little arguing, and a whole lot of fun await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/2d72497ff2a238a112e0c2f07b294cfd.poster.avif?t=1784115329\" aria-label=\"Co-Drive Chaos Course\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/2d72497ff2a238a112e0c2f07b294cfd.webm?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/2d72497ff2a238a112e0c2f07b294cfd.mp4?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU IN THIS GAME?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARED DRIVING MECHANIC:</strong> In this game, two players control a single car. One player can only steer to the right, while the other can only steer to the left. To complete the courses, you must coordinate and work together with your friend.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/f81762d8c5b1241792bd923e1eae2d05.poster.avif?t=1784115329\" aria-label=\"Co-Drive Chaos Crash\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/f81762d8c5b1241792bd923e1eae2d05.webm?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/f81762d8c5b1241792bd923e1eae2d05.mp4?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARED MECHANICS:</strong> The accelerator, brake, and nitro can be used by both players, and using them together increases their effectiveness. Even though these controls are not split between players, coordination is still important.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/8060abee50cfff3dc8e69e6aaf400fbc.poster.avif?t=1784115329\" aria-label=\"Co-Drive Chaos Gate\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/8060abee50cfff3dc8e69e6aaf400fbc.webm?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/8060abee50cfff3dc8e69e6aaf400fbc.mp4?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS-BASED OBSTACLES:</strong> Moving cacti, moving platforms, pushing walls, and rotating propeller pillars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUMMY:</strong> Watch out for the mummies trying to make your journey harder with the bombs in their hands. Be extra careful around the ones with bazookas. They will do everything they can to knock you off the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/f0ef0e8ed676fa9ecec9281c6d0264f8.poster.avif?t=1784115329\" aria-label=\"Co-Drive Chaos Priest\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/f0ef0e8ed676fa9ecec9281c6d0264f8.webm?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/f0ef0e8ed676fa9ecec9281c6d0264f8.mp4?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRIEST:</strong> If you have lost your way, follow the priest. He will show you the path.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Drive Chaos – One Car, Two Drivers, Endless Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a car together with a friend and make your way through the courses. If you can, of course. In this 3D obstacle course game that puts your friendship to the test, a little tension, a little arguing, and a whole lot of fun await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/2d72497ff2a238a112e0c2f07b294cfd.poster.avif?t=1784115329\" aria-label=\"Co-Drive Chaos Course\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/2d72497ff2a238a112e0c2f07b294cfd.webm?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265920/extras/2d72497ff2a238a112e0c2f07b294cfd.mp4?t=1784115329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU IN THIS GAME?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARED DRIVING MECHANIC:</strong> In this game, two players control a single car. One player can only steer to the right, while the other can only steer to the left. To complete the courses, you must coordinate and work together with your friend.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p